, and WINTER'S TEETH is effectively another sold sale of a V5 book. Chapters, the new Vampire Card Game, and other spin offs are also measures of V5's popularity as the audience isn't going to be limited to traditional tabletop buyers as they're trying to broaden it as far as possible.<br /> <br /> I feel the online games being watched are also equivalent to Convention attendence and Fanclub participation equivalent to the 90s Camarilla, just virtually.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> that's probably by far the most asinine thing i've seen anybody post on this forum.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25992-archderd","name":"archderd","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25992_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-16T04:42:28-07:00","id":1444159,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>archderd</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1443592-the-official-v5-vs-v20-thread?p=1444158#post1444158\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">that's probably by far the most asinine thing i've seen anybody post on this forum.</div> </div> </div> </div><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">I feel like this is a good example of what <b>not </b>to post in this thread.</span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Ar