d I don\u2019t think he truly understands the disparity in power dynamics that his ability to drop red text any time a discussion isn\u2019t going his way has on the discussions he involves himself in and what people feel safe in pushing back with against his ideas.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":10}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1328-chris24601","name":"Chris24601","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"520"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-01T11:29:35-07:00","id":1453955,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Chris24601</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1443592-the-official-v5-vs-v20-thread?p=1453950#post1453950\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Honestly, if he weren\u2019t a mod, I\u2019d have put Phipps on ignore ages ago. He may not think he\u2019s coming off like he does, but he does and I don\u2019t think he truly understands the disparity in power dynamics that his ability to drop red text any time a discussion isn\u2019t going his way has on the discussions he involves himself in and what people feel safe in pushing back with against his ideas.</div> </div> </div> </div>I wish I could more than &quot;like&quot; this post.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9015-zee-patrick","name":"zee PaTrick","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"56"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-01T14:48:18-07:00","id":1453968,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Since I am the mod, let me clear. If you get upset over posts in this thread and feel the need not to report but shitpost, don't return to it ever again.<br /> <br /> Attacks against any posters or their style of gaming is a ban worthy offense.</span><br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Chris24601</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1443592-the-official-v5-vs-v20-thread?p=1453950#post1453950\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Honestly, if he weren\u2019t a mod, I\u2019d have put Phipps on ignore ages ago. He may not think he\u2019s coming off like he does, but he does and I don\u2019t think he truly understands the disparity in power dynamics that his ability to drop red text any time a discussion isn\u2019t going his way has on the discussions he involves himself in and what people feel safe in pushing back with against his ideas.</div> </div> </div> </div>The funny thing about this is that I don't give infractions to people who attack me but quite a lot of times the attacks on me do get reported by OTHER posters. So they tend to actually get a free ride that they wouldn't normally. I also have intervened on behalf of several posters who were going to be permanently banned for V5 complaints or attacks on OPP. It's not hard to follow the rules: don't attack fellow posters, don't attack OPP, be respectful of the fact that OPP publishers V20 and V5 products both.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":12002,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","user":"CTPhipps","date":". 07-01-2021, 06:01 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-01T15:12:16-07:00","id":1453977,"title":"","content":"I'm done. You win.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writing up Clanbook: Aabbt","edited":{"userid":700,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/700-vysha","user":"Vysha","date":". 07-01-2021, 06:16 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/700-vysha","name":"Vysha","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar700_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"602"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-01T15:22:43-07:00","id":1453982,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vysha</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1443592-the-official-v5-vs-v20-thread?p=1453977#post1453977\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm done. You win.</div> </div> </div> </div>There's no winning or losing in gaming let alone discussion of gaming in a forum devoted to its celebration. There's no one who can possibly be right or wrong because it's all a matter of preference. No one's method of play is better or worse than anyone else's.<br /> <br /> It's all about whether or not you and your players have fun.<br /> <br /> But I don't want to cause anyone to feel uncomfortable so I'll leave you to enjoy the thread. I hope your forum experience improves.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-01T15:45:18-07:00","id":1453989,"title":"","content":"Edited words. Please delete.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writing up Clanbook: Aabbt","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/700-vysha","name":"Vysha","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar700_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"602"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-01T15:54:44-07:00","id":1453991,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1443592-the-official-v5-vs-v20-thread?p=1453968#post1453968\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Since I am the mod, let me clear. If you get upset over posts in this thread and feel the need not to report but shitpost, don't return to it ever again.<br /> <br /> Attacks against any posters or their style of gaming is a ban worthy offense.</span></div> </div> </div> </div>I'm sorry but I think I need it to be made a little clearer.<br /> <br /> I'm unclear on who was making attacks against posters or their style of gaming, so I don't see what constitutes an attack in your eyes. Vysha was pointing out that the tone you used in your comment felt dismissive, I pointed out that similar language in your reply to me felt dismissive, and another person posted about power dynamics of the role of moderator being one of the two most active people in a thread.<br /> <br /> Now you're posting that someone needs to never return to this thread ever again, and it isn't clear what attack and what shitposting you're referring to - the vagueness gives it exactly the kind of power dynamic misalignment that was being referred to prior to the thread being closed.<br /> <br /> I'm just not seeing a post where a user attacked another user, attacked Onyx Path, or disrespected that Onyx Path published V20 and V5 content.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":23889,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23889-dirtypoolfilms","user":"dirtypoolfilms","date":". 07-01-2021, 06:56 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":10}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23889-dirtypoolfilms","name":"dirtypoolfilms","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"36"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-01T17:04:01-07:00","id":1454002,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>dirtypoolfilms</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1443592-the-official-v5-vs-v20-thread?p=1453991#post1453991\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I'm sorry but I think I need it to be made a little clearer.<br /> <br /> I'm unclear on who was making attacks against posters or their style of gaming, so I don't see what constitutes an attack in your eyes. Vysha was pointing out that the tone you used in your comment felt dismissive, I pointed out that similar language in your reply to me felt dismissive, and another person posted about power dynamics of the role of moderator being one of the two most active people in a thread.<br /> <br /> Now you're posting that someone needs to never return to this thread ever again, and it isn't clear what attack and what shitposting you're referring to - the vagueness gives it exactly the kind of power dynamic misalignment that was being referred to prior to the thread being closed.<br /> <br /> I'm just not seeing a post where a user attacked another user, attacked Onyx Path, or disrespected that Onyx Path published V20 and V5 content.</div> </div> </div> </div><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Very well:<br /> <br /> 1. It is not the place of other posters to correct the tone of anyone. That is what reporting posts is for. A dismissive post can and should be deleted by mods.<br /> <br /> 2. If you're worried about arguing with moderators, the question should be whether there should be arguing directly. This is a forum for discussion not arguments.<br /> <br /> 3. Commenting on other posters is absolutely forbidden. Restrict your arguments to their arguments not them.<br /> <br /> 4. No one has been banned from the thread. They have been told not to return if they cannot refrain from violating the rules. An assumption of such is that they will continue to do so.<br /> <br /> 5. The ultimate rule stated at the beginning of the thread is to be respectful of other posters and all editions as well as arguments.<br /> <br /> As for leaving the thread, I don't want people to be upset and not enjoy the thread I opened after the topic was banned. The goal is for a harmonious fun forum for all.</span><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Strai